{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部回應美國政府據報要求政府機構停止使用來自中國企業的DeepSeek等人工智能工具。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n發言人毛寧在例行記者會表示，中方一貫反對泛化國家安全概念、將科技經貿問題政治化，中方將堅決維護中國企業的合法權益。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:49.390511+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:45:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:58:05.937741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:44.068106+00:00","content_hash":"ab8fe1b6cd82d1cead01b3c5385f16497477d42c4fa082385b0e9325a4e1b1d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}